<section class="cs-section" id="hook">
  <div class="cs-intro-copy">
    <h2>Spotify knows my&nbsp;playlists, my&nbsp;habits, my&nbsp;most&nbsp;played&nbsp;genres.</h2>
    <p class="cs-subtitle">It&nbsp;knows nothing about how&nbsp;I&nbsp;actually perceive&nbsp;music.</p>
    <div class="cs-intro-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-hero-visual cs-artifact">
    <img src="/assets/spotify/logo.png" alt="Spotify redesign wordmark: a soft gradient icon next to the Spotify name on a dark navy background." style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
